      "central_taylor_tail": "tau_r=trace((I-P_V)T_B(I-P_V))<=delta/pi*(delta/2)^(2*r)/((2*r+1)^2*(r!)^2)",
      "claim_separation": "central-band capture does not bound the exterior weighted defect, rank does not determine orientation, and neither conditional interval probes nor finite fixtures prove a physical prolate estimate",
